      // (the flood laps out to the floor's edge, its brine thinning over the last 7 units, unevenly — cut off there by the outline,
      // the Crystal Crab's flood ended in long straight edges across the salt at the front fence; the hero is never nearer the
      // edge than his radius, 6: the visual loop, 2026-10-30)
      // (and his tides' brine the same, running out across the floor to its edge — +16, the flood or a tide)
      // (and Gnasher's acid pool, +32: spat at the hero, by the floor's edge it was cut off by the outline in a straight line —
