        // +8 crystal — the salt crystallising where he will strike: the crust's own polygon cells (the salt flat's) lit along
        // their seams in rose as the fill creeps in, paler and glinting as the time runs out; struck, a flash of pale crystal;
        // after, the seams fade. +16 brine, the tide's and the flood's — the salt soaked dark where the brine will run, its
